    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on a skateboard and casually save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Simple controls\u2014just pick a lane!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horizontal movement and attacks are all automatic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the controls are basic, there's plenty of depth for you to sink your teeth into in Skateboard Knight, an action RPG-esque roguelite game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Beat waves of enemies to level up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start every journey at level 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies to raise your level and pick skills to become stronger and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple but intuitive and addictive adventure that you can't put down awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Change classes at level 20!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach level 20, you evolve into different classes based on the skills you learned up to that point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classes all have their own powerful class skills and unlock new level up skills too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use different classes and make different skill builds each playthrough to always get a fresh experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Collect coins on your journey to develop the kingdom! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock power-ups for your knight, research new skills, forge new weapons, and even find new companions to travel with... There's a lot of work to be done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the kingdom to become permanently stronger between runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Best for times like this...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt's a hassle to play games with complicated or frantic controls... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBut entirely auto or idle games aren't as exciting... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the perfect game for those days you feel like playing a game, but want something you can sit back and enjoy instead of something too hardcore!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hop on a skateboard and casually save the world!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Simple controls\u2014just pick a lane!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Horizontal movement and attacks are all automatic!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Though the controls are basic, there's plenty of depth for you to sink your teeth into in Skateboard Knight, an action RPG-esque roguelite game. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Beat waves of enemies to level up!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start every journey at level 0!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Beat enemies to raise your level and pick skills to become stronger and stronger!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A simple but intuitive and addictive adventure that you can't put down awaits...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Change classes at level 20!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you reach level 20, you evolve into different classes based on the skills you learned up to that point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The classes all have their own powerful class skills and unlock new level up skills too.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can use different classes and make different skill builds each playthrough to always get a fresh experience!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Collect coins on your journey to develop the kingdom! </h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlock power-ups for your knight, research new skills, forge new weapons, and even find new companions to travel with... There's a lot of work to be done!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Develop the kingdom to become permanently stronger between runs!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u25cf Best for times like this...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbIt's a hassle to play games with complicated or frantic controls... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u30fbBut entirely auto or idle games aren't as exciting... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is the perfect game for those days you feel like playing a game, but want something you can sit back and enjoy instead of something too hardcore!</p>",
    "short_description": "Hop on a skateboard and casually save the world! Simple controls\u2014just move up or down the lanes. Horizontal movement and attacks are all auto!",
